      "text": [
        "321 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ سَرَّحَ لِحْيَتَهُ سَبْعِينَ مَرَّةً وَ عَدَّهَا مَرَّةً مَرَّةً لَمْ يَقْرَبْهُ اَلشَّيْطَانُ أَرْبَعِينَ يَوْماً."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.321 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Whoever combs their beard seventy times and counts it one by one will not be approached by Shaytan (Satan) for forty days.\""
        ]
      }
